• Work with Ops Excellence, SCM Tech, and other CA/global resources to enable our team and deliver on system, data, and process improvements within the DC

• Lead and build a work environment focused on Health &amp; Safety. Work in compliance with OH&amp;S acts and regulations.&nbsp;

• Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&nbsp;

• Other duties as assigned

